From: lfdevs <lfdevs@lfdevs.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 03:54:03 +0800
Subject: backend: add Anland transport and output backend

Add the Anland 5.13 display-daemon transport, DMA-BUF-backed output, virtual input devices, and reconnect handling. Expose the backend through WLR_BACKENDS=anland and the ANLAND_SOCKET environment variable.
